    "body": "> Why do you think that's an accurate rephrasing of the spec? The spec allows the browser to choose\r\n\r\nMy intent is not to explain the spec, but to describe current browser behavior. At present, Chrome navigate the page to registered URL. If `<a target=\"_blank\">`, Chrome open the target URL in new tab, but developers can't control these websites.",
